      "content": "That's really beautiful writing. I love the \"lighthouse\" metaphor. To make it even more impactful for our audience, could you add a sentence or two that draws a sharper contrast? Maybe something that suggests why the more fluid or non-traditional arrangements nowadays often fail to provide that same sense of stability or psychological safety?",
